From 30339303bedcb5cb9a6d8fe2e495f381f05d7c74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:49:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Windows node: carry A's verifier consumers (df8fbafae)
 and ERC-1271 owner fix (c3a61fd1a)

From A's immutable e32dd607b55b9c6afd605482a4bc31c9d30528d6 lineage. Only the Windows and shared modules; the CLI/MCP
integration of e32dd607b (and its opt-in pinnedClient allowCall in network/verified-chain.mjs) is left to A, so
verified-chain.mjs stays df8fbafae's e55f0359.

- 3-way merges (base 71448f63b, theirs df8fbafae) onto the installed keeper lineage, each byte-equal to D's
  receipts/proposals/a-port: windows/node agent, chain (keeper 3e9fae03 kept), host (keeper ea0f6b8a kept),
  network-enroll, host-identity, host-onchain, session-api-auth; node-config.example.cmd (--union, doc only).
- Taken whole from df8fbafae (ours equal to A's base or absent): windows/node/chain-reader.mjs,
  network/host-admission-node.mjs, network/host-service-gate-carriers.mjs, network/verified-read-client.mjs,
  test/windows-chain-authority.test.mjs, test/helpers/windows-chain-driver.mjs.
- network/enclave-network-host.mjs: c3a61fd1a's owner-verification change merged onto the INSTALLED source (base
  df8fbafae, theirs c3a61fd1a), not A's copy of it.
- Taken from c3a61fd1a: test/network-owner-verifier.test.mjs, test/windows-verifier.e2e.test.mjs.
- scripts/build-host-admission.mjs: the bundle entry is network/host-admission-node.mjs (the carriers gate wrapper plus
  the verified-read exports the merged chain/chain-reader import), as in A.
- test/node-policy-carriers.test.mjs: the installed platform-carrier package's test (4e949c09). Its parity case allows
  exactly one additive status field (runtime.chainAuthority, from 14d1e495) and asserts it is 'provider-quorum'.
- windows/node/host-admission.bundle.mjs and metal/guest/host-policy.bundle.mjs regenerated (--check clean). The metal
  bundle is a Linux image input; no image is rebuilt here.
